     1	"""Deterministic reference-RIR manifest for the AcousticRooms unseen test split.
     2	
     3	``xRIR_Dataset`` picks the ``num_shot`` reference RIRs of a query with a worker-local
     4	``np.random.choice`` whose draw is never recorded, so two evaluation runs -- and two
