     8	This module re-derives the same *kind* of draw as a pure function of
     9	``(manifest seed, query path)``: the selection is independent of batch size, worker
    10	count, model and directory listing order, and the resulting manifest (query path +
    11	reference paths) is written once, hashed, and asserted by every run.
    12	
    13	The candidate set and the with-replacement fallback mirror
    14	``xRIR_Dataset.get_ir_and_location_for_other_sources`` exactly; only the *choice* is
