The remaining issues are in admission checks and reporting: the producers special-case exp_04’s `aug` role, so adding a profile name alone will not support three new training records. The table writer also supports only one generated block and stores EDT in milliseconds. The budget should use the cylindrical run’s measured 31.36 hours, and the schedule should account for exp_06’s current estimate of about 42 GPU-hours.
